title: "Upstream: An open-source platform for environmental sensor data collection and publishing"
version: v1.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-16
url: "https://github.com/wmobley/upstream"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wmobley/upstream"
abstract: >
  Upstream is a full-stack platform for collecting, managing, and publishing
  environmental sensor data. It supports a hierarchical data model
  (Campaigns → Stations → Sensors → Measurements), interactive visualization,
  and open data publishing via CKAN. Upstream is deployed on TACC Tapis Pods
  and is designed for field researchers working with time-series and
  geospatial sensor data.
keywords:
  - environmental monitoring
  - sensor data
  - time series
  - geospatial
  - open data
  - CKAN
  - Tapis
